              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Guards have hand weapon, light armour and shield and may have heavy armour (+1) and large shield (+1) and thrusting spear (+2). They may exchange hand weapon and shield for two handed sword (+2). They are Drilled and Stubborn.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
